              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "You need the \"Manage Group Phone Numbers\" permission to update a group number. You can only update your own personal numbers.\n\nYou can:\n\n- Change a `label` of your number.\n- Set up call forwarding via `forward_to` and `forward_to_enabled`.\n- Set up a voicemail greeting by including a URL of an mp3 recording in `voicemail_greeting_url`. We require the URL to be secure (i.e. starting with https://).\n- Modify which team members are part of a group number via `participants`. This should be a list of"
        },
        {
